{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 69,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Save me, O God;\nFor the waters are come in unto my soul.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I sink in deep mire, where there is no standing:\nI am come into deep waters, where the floods overflow me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am weary with my crying; my throat is dried:\nMine eyes fail while I wait for my God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that hate me without a cause are more than the hairs of my head:\nThey that would cut me off, being mine enemies wrongfully, are mighty:\nThat which I took not away I have to restore.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O God, thou knowest my foolishness;\nAnd my sins are not hid from thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let not them that wait for thee be put to shame through me, O Lord Jehovah of hosts:\nLet not those that seek thee be brought to dishonor through me, O God of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because for thy sake I have borne reproach;\nShame hath covered my face.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am become a stranger unto my brethren,\nAnd an alien unto my mother’s children.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the zeal of thy house hath eaten me up;\nAnd the reproaches of them that reproach thee are fallen upon me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I wept, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and chastened",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my soul with fasting,\nThat was to my reproach.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I made sackcloth my clothing,\nI became a byword unto them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that sit in the gate talk of me;\nAnd ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "I am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the song of the drunkards.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But as for me, my prayer is unto thee, O Jehovah, in an acceptable time:\nO God, in the abundance of thy lovingkindness,\nAnswer me in the truth of thy salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver me out of the mire, and let me not sink:\nLet me be delivered from them that hate me, and out of the deep waters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let not the waterflood overwhelm me,\nNeither let the deep swallow me up;\nAnd let not the pit shut its mouth upon me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Answer me, O Jehovah; for thy lovingkindness is good:\nAccording to the multitude of thy tender mercies turn thou unto me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And hide not thy face from thy servant;\nFor I am in distress; answer me speedily.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Draw nigh unto my soul, and redeem it:\nRansom me because of mine enemies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou knowest my reproach, and my shame, and my dishonor:\nMine adversaries are all before thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Reproach hath broken my heart; and I am full of heaviness:\nAnd I looked for some to take pity, but there was none;\nAnd for comforters, but I found none.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They gave me also gall for my food;\nAnd in my thirst they gave me vinegar to drink.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let their table before them become a snare;\nAnd when they are in peace, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "let it become",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a trap.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let their eyes be darkened, so that they cannot see;\nAnd make their loins continually to shake.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Pour out thine indignation upon them,\nAnd let the fierceness of thine anger overtake them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let their habitation be desolate;\nLet none dwell in their tents.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they persecute him whom thou hast smitten;\nAnd they tell of the sorrow of those whom thou hast wounded.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Add iniquity unto their iniquity;\nAnd let them not come into thy righteousness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them be blotted out of the book of life,\nAnd not be written with the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I am poor and sorrowful:\nLet thy salvation, O God, set me up on high.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will praise the name of God with a song,\nAnd will magnify him with thanksgiving.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it will please Jehovah better than an ox,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a bullock that hath horns and hoofs.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The meek have seen it, and are glad:\nYe that seek after God, let your heart live.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Jehovah heareth the needy,\nAnd despiseth not his prisoners.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let heaven and earth praise him,\nThe seas, and everything that moveth therein.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For God will save Zion, and build the cities of Judah;\nAnd they shall abide there, and have it in possession.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.69.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.69.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The seed also of his servants shall inherit it;\nAnd they that love his name shall dwell therein.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "A cry of distress, and imprecation on adversaries.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician; set to That is, Lilies.Shoshannim. A Psalm of David.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
